  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1911972598}
  m_Text: "Welcome to \"The Toby Foliage Engine\", a \nsingle-pivot vegetation system
    that tries to\nmimic multiple pivots per mesh.\r\n\nPBR shading and wind based
    on vertex\r\nposition volume. Control the\r size of your\nvolume to mask out
    wind in your material\nsettings.\n\nUse \"[DEBUG] Visualize Wind Mask\" to visualize
    wind physics."
