  m_Text: 'Season color is locked, it can''t be changed

    with the (TTFE) GLOBAL
    CONTROLLER slider.


    Useful for having dry or different-colored trees

    in
    any season.


    Set "Dry Leaves - Scale and Offset" to "0,0" to

    achieve
    this (default values are "1,1").'
